2902
04:33:48,110 --> 04:33:48,770
Shadow Six

2903
04:33:49,170 --> 04:33:49,470
嗨 Oliver

2904
04:33:49,650 --> 04:33:50,190
爱你 伙计

2905
04:33:50,450 --> 04:33:51,630
